{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 2.0 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/module-federation","wordCount":773,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"module-federation-2-0-实战\">Module Federation 2.0 实战</h1><p>Module Federation 2.0 于 2026 年 2 月正式发布稳定版，由字节跳动 Web Infra 团队与原作者 Zack Jackson 共同维护。相比 v1，它解决了三个核心痛点：跨应用 TypeScript 类型丢失、远程模块的静态发现困难、以及与 Webpack 的深度绑定。2.0 的架构哲学是「运行时与构建工具解耦」——同一套 Runtime API 可以在 Webpack、Rspack、Vite、Rollup 上运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph MF1[&quot;Module Federation 1.x&quot;]&#10;        A1[Webpack 5 内置插件] --&gt; B1[remoteEntry.js]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[运行时加载]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph MF2[&quot;Module Federation 2.0&quot;]&#10;        A2[Enhanced Plugin] --&gt; B2[mf-manifest.json]&#10;        A2 --&gt; D2[自动类型生成 .d.ts]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[统一 Runtime]&#10;        C2 --&gt; E2[Webpack]&#10;        C2 --&gt; F2[Rspack]&#10;        C2 --&gt; G2[Vite]&#10;        C2 --&gt; H2[Rollup/Rolldown]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph MF1[\"Module Federation 1.x\"]\n        A1[Webpack 5 内置插件] --&gt; B1[remoteEntry.js]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[运行时加载]\n    end\n    subgraph MF2[\"Module Federation 2.0\"]\n        A2[Enhanced Plugin] --&gt; B2[mf-manifest.json]\n        A2 --&gt; D2[自动类型生成 .d.ts]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[统一 Runtime]\n        C2 --&gt; E2[Webpack]\n        C2 --&gt; F2[Rspack]\n        C2 --&gt; G2[Vite]\n        C2 --&gt; H2[Rollup/Rolldown]\n    end</pre><p>关键变化总结：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MF 1.x</th>\n<th>MF 2.0</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>打包器支持</td>\n<td>仅 Webpack 5</td>\n<td>Webpack/Rspack/Vite/Rollup/Rolldown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>无（手动维护 .d.ts 或 any）</td>\n<td>自动生成 + Hot Reload</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程发现</td>\n<td>硬编码 remoteEntry URL</td>\n<td>mf-manifest.json 动态发现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享依赖</td>\n<td>全量加载</td>\n<td>支持 Tree Shaking（最高减 75%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSR 支持</td>\n<td>无官方方案</td>\n<td>Modern.js 集成，Node.js 一等公民</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试工具</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Chrome DevTools 扩展 + Side Effect Scanner</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基础配置-host-与-remote\">基础配置：Host 与 Remote</h2><h3 id=\"remote-暴露模块的子应用\">Remote（暴露模块的子应用）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// product-app/rsbuild.config.ts（Rspack 场景）&#10;import { ModuleFederationPlugin } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/rspack&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;product&#39;,&#10;      exposes: {&#10;        &#39;./ProductList&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductList&#39;,&#10;        &#39;./ProductDetail&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductDetail&#39;,&#10;        &#39;./useProduct&#39;: &#39;./src/hooks/useProduct&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      shared: {&#10;        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;        &#39;react-dom&#39;: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;      },&#10;      // 2.0 新增：自动类型生成&#10;      dts: {&#10;        generateTypes: true,&#10;        consumeTypes: true,&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// product-app/rsbuild.config.ts（Rspack 场景）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ModuleFederationPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/rspack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exposes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './useProduct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/hooks/useProduct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        react: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 2.0 新增：自动类型生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dts: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        generateTypes: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        consumeTypes: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"host-消费模块的壳应用\">Host（消费模块的壳应用）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// host-app/rsbuild.config.ts&#10;import { ModuleFederationPlugin } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/rspack&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;host&#39;,&#10;      remotes: {&#10;        // 指向 manifest 而非 remoteEntry（2.0 推荐）&#10;        product: &#39;product@https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json&#39;,&#10;        checkout: &#39;checkout@https://checkout.example.com/mf-manifest.json&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      shared: {&#10;        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;        &#39;react-dom&#39;: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// host-app/rsbuild.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ModuleFederationPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/rspack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'host'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      remotes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 指向 manifest 而非 remoteEntry（2.0 推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        product: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product@https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        checkout: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout@https://checkout.example.com/mf-manifest.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        react: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"动态类型提示\">动态类型提示</h2><p>MF 2.0 最受欢迎的特性。开发时，Host 会自动下载 Remote 生成的 <code>.d.ts</code> 文件，IDE 可以提供完整的自动补全和类型检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Host 中消费 Remote 模块——完整类型提示&#10;import { ProductList } from &#39;product/ProductList&#39;;&#10;// ProductList 的 props 类型已自动从 Remote 获取&#10;// IDE 能识别 ProductListProps: { category: string; limit?: number }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Host 中消费 Remote 模块——完整类型提示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ProductList } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'product/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ProductList 的 props 类型已自动从 Remote 获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// IDE 能识别 ProductListProps: { category: string; limit?: number }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>类型更新支持 Hot Reload：Remote 修改了 exposed 模块的类型后，Host 在 dev 模式下会自动拉取最新的 <code>.d.ts</code>，无需重启。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享依赖的-tree-shaking\">共享依赖的 Tree Shaking</h2><p>MF 1.x 的共享依赖是全量打包——即使只用了 Ant Design 的 3 个组件，shared bundle 仍包含整个库。MF 2.0 通过 <code>treeShaking</code> 选项解决了这个问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;  shared: {&#10;    antd: {&#10;      singleton: true,&#10;      requiredVersion: &#39;^5.0.0&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  // 开启 shared tree shaking&#10;  treeShaking: true,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    antd: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^5.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 开启 shared tree shaking</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  treeShaking: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种运行模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>runtime-infer</strong>：零配置，运行时优先复用已加载的精简 bundle，不足时 fallback 到全量</li>\n<li><strong>server-calc</strong>：CI 分析全局依赖使用情况，产出最优的精简方案，适合大型系统</li>\n</ul>\n<p>官方数据：Ant Design 仅使用 Badge/Button/List 三个组件时，shared bundle 从 1404KB 降至 344KB，减少 75.5%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-api-无构建配置的动态联邦\">Runtime API：无构建配置的动态联邦</h2><p>2.0 提供了脱离构建配置的纯运行时 API，适合需要动态注册远程模块的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { init, loadRemote, preloadRemotes } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/runtime&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 运行时初始化（适合 A/B 测试动态加载不同远程）&#10;init({&#10;  name: &#39;host&#39;,&#10;  remotes: [{ name: &#39;product&#39;, entry: &#39;https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json&#39; }],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 预加载关键远程模块&#10;await preloadRemotes([&#10;  {&#10;    nameOrAlias: &#39;checkout&#39;,&#10;    exposes: [&#39;./CheckoutFlow&#39;],&#10;    resourceCategory: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;]);&#10;&#10;// 按需加载&#10;const { ProductList } = await loadRemote(&#39;product/ProductList&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { init, loadRemote, preloadRemotes } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/runtime'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 运行时初始化（适合 A/B 测试动态加载不同远程）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'host'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remotes: [{ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预加载关键远程模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preloadRemotes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nameOrAlias: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exposes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./CheckoutFlow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resourceCategory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按需加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ProductList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadRemote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"rspack-与-mf-2-0-的组合\">Rspack 与 MF 2.0 的组合</h2><p>Rspack 是字节跳动开源的 Rust 实现的 Webpack 兼容打包器，构建速度比 Webpack 5 快 5-10 倍。MF 2.0 对 Rspack 的支持是一等公民：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@module-federation/enhanced/rspack</code> 直接集成</li>\n<li>无需额外的 Babel 转换，Rspack 原生处理 MF 语法</li>\n<li>开发模式下的 HMR 保持与 Webpack 一致的体验</li>\n<li>生产构建时间在 50+ 远程模块的项目中从 180s 降至 25s</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MF 2.0 的核心范式转变：运行时与打包器解耦，mf-manifest.json 取代硬编码 URL</li>\n<li>动态类型提示彻底解决了跨应用类型丢失的开发体验问题</li>\n<li>shared tree shaking 在大型组件库场景下可减少 70%+ 的重复加载</li>\n<li>Rspack + MF 2.0 是 2026 年性能与开发体验的最优组合</li>\n<li>Runtime API 适合需要 A/B 测试和动态加载的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"single-spa-framework\">Single-SPA 与运行时编排</a> — 与 MF 互补的运行时方案</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../build-tooling-bundlers/bundlers/webpack-deep\">构建工具 hub — Webpack 深度解析</a> — MF 底层依赖的 Webpack 插件机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Module Federation 2.0 实战","id":"module-federation-2-0-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础配置：Host 与 Remote","id":"基础配置-host-与-remote"},{"level":3,"text":"Remote（暴露模块的子应用）","id":"remote-暴露模块的子应用"},{"level":3,"text":"Host（消费模块的壳应用）","id":"host-消费模块的壳应用"},{"level":2,"text":"动态类型提示","id":"动态类型提示"},{"level":2,"text":"共享依赖的 Tree Shaking","id":"共享依赖的-tree-shaking"},{"level":2,"text":"Runtime API：无构建配置的动态联邦","id":"runtime-api-无构建配置的动态联邦"},{"level":2,"text":"Rspack 与 MF 2.0 的组合","id":"rspack-与-mf-2-0-的组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"路由协调与跨应用通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/foundations/routing-communication"},"next":{"title":"Single-SPA 与运行时编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/single-spa-framework"}}